+## Usage reported to `afterModelResponse`
+
+- `afterModelResponse` is handed the usage of the whole turn: the sum of `inputTokens`, `outputTokens` and `totalTokens` over every provider call the turn made, so a turn that ran tool rounds is counted in full rather than by its last call ([validated by: reports the sum of every provider call in a turn that ran two tool rounds](../../src/orchestration/turnUsage.acceptance.test.ts#L59)).
+- A round whose provider reports no usage adds nothing to the sum rather than making it `undefined` or `NaN`, and a turn in which no round reported usage hands the hook no usage at all ([validated by: counts only the rounds that reported usage, and reports none when no round did](../../src/orchestration/turnUsage.acceptance.test.ts#L71)).
+
